{"id":"a7fc9a5f08d87b69","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-one-event-clock.md","title":"允许空阶段的单事件枚举时钟","display":"df-one-event-clock — 允许空阶段的单事件枚举时钟","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-one-event-clock","aliases":["20-df-one-event-clock"],"display":"df-one-event-clock — 允许空阶段的单事件枚举时钟","chapter":"2","section":"2.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 2.6.1；Convention 2.6.2 的含空步版本","source_printed_pages":[46,47],"source_pdf_pages":[82,83],"depends_on":["[[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]","[[20-df-finite-code]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-one-event-clock"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-one-event-clock</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-one-event-clock — 允许空阶段的单事件枚举时钟"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 2.6.1；Convention 2.6.2 的含空步版本"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>46</span><span>47</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>82</span><span>83</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" href=\"?note=fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" title=\"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence\">20-df-uniform-ce-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(a\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=(V_e)_{e\\in\\omega}\">\\(V=(V_e)_{e\\in\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_{e,s}^a:=D_{a(e,s)}\">\\(V_{e,s}^a:=D_{a(e,s)}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" href=\"?note=fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" title=\"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence\">20-df-uniform-ce-sequence</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}one\\text{-}event\\text{-}clock}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\\operatorname{Clock}(a,V)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e,s\\ [V_{e,0}^a=\\varnothing\\land V_{e,s}^a\\subseteq V_{e,s+1}^a\\land V_{e,s}^a\\subseteq\\{x:x&lt;s\\}\\land(e\\ge s\\Rightarrow V_{e,s}^a=\\varnothing)\\land V_e=\\bigcup_tV_{e,t}^a]\\\\ \\land\\forall s\\ \\left|\\{\\langle e,x\\rangle:x\\in V_{e,s+1}^a\\setminus V_{e,s}^a\\}\\right|\\le1.\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}one\\text{-}event\\text{-}clock}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\\operatorname{Clock}(a,V)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e,s\\ [V_{e,0}^a=\\varnothing\\land V_{e,s}^a\\subseteq V_{e,s+1}^a\\land V_{e,s}^a\\subseteq\\{x:x&lt;s\\}\\land(e\\ge s\\Rightarrow V_{e,s}^a=\\varnothing)\\land V_e=\\bigcup_tV_{e,t}^a]\\\\ \\land\\forall s\\ \\left|\\{\\langle e,x\\rangle:x\\in V_{e,s+1}^a\\setminus V_{e,s}^a\\}\\right|\\le1.\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>a(e,s) 是完整有限成员代码；不同于 partial s.c.e. 函数 h 的事件序号。空阶段使有限总关系和延迟事件也有统一全时钟，不必决定某个集合是否还有新成员。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 2.6.1；Convention 2.6.2 的含空步版本；印刷页 46, 47；PDF 第 82, 83 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"fc75264a5ecdc3fb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"fc75264a5ecdc3fb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"V=(V_e)_{e\\in\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"V_{e,s}^a:=D_{a(e,s)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}one\\text{-}event\\text{-}clock}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\\operatorname{Clock}(a,V)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e,s\\ [V_{e,0}^a=\\varnothing\\land V_{e,s}^a\\subseteq V_{e,s+1}^a\\land V_{e,s}^a\\subseteq\\{x:x<s\\}\\land(e\\ge s\\Rightarrow V_{e,s}^a=\\varnothing)\\land V_e=\\bigcup_tV_{e,t}^a]\\\\ \\land\\forall s\\ \\left|\\{\\langle e,x\\rangle:x\\in V_{e,s+1}^a\\setminus V_{e,s}^a\\}\\right|\\le1.\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1643,"backlinks":[{"id":"9190004194115561","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-one-event-clock]]。"},{"id":"7f69e9730e0b4b31","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-dynamic-differences]]；see [[20-df-one-event-clock]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"8ec065689fdce567","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-one-event-clock]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"}],"outgoing":["fc75264a5ecdc3fb","59004ac6d23e86f8","e343870c773cb68e"]}